nt crops, bushes, and breed animals using the semen blaster<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/320c5ea3d6cbb3c9586b421b15a074b9.poster.avif?t=1603284673\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/320c5ea3d6cbb3c9586b421b15a074b9.webm?t=1603284673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/320c5ea3d6cbb3c9586b421b15a074b9.mp4?t=1603284673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Caves full of ores, materials, and poop that you can gather and trade with merchants<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/e2e6672c1fccd6e7a5de42f42ef43135.poster.avif?t=1603284673\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/e2e6672c1fccd6e7a5de42f42ef43135.webm?t=1603284673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/e2e6672c1fccd6e7a5de42f42ef43135.mp4?t=1603284673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Three different game modes: survival - the default game experience, creative - enabling you to build and experiment in peace, and hardcore - a permadeath mode<br><br></li><li> ...and more!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274090/extras/d0b2551394ef579f4aa8fac57f7718c0.avif?t=1603284673\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><br>Because this is a solo indie game, I can keep adding new content and support the game for years to come, purely out of passion. Here's wha